# Technician-app mirror bundle (public/technician-mirror/<version>/).
# A ~14 MB Expo static web export, rebuilt per app release — deliberately NOT
# a git object. The Dockerfile's `mirror` stage takes it through the build
# context from ./mirror-app/ and actively deletes any committed copy, so a
# bundle in here would be carried in history for nothing. Build it locally
# with `npm run export:mirror` in Easyfix_Technician_Mobile_Application.
/public/technician-mirror/
/mirror-app/
